OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer assaulted at
OL,4,Aprotest against academic
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating an assault on
OL,7,Fan officer after a protest against a
OL,8,Ftalk by the academic who accused the
OL,9,Flate Professor Jason Arday of
OL,10,Fplagiarism.
OL,12,FHundreds of people gathered outside the
OL,13,FUniversity of Oxford's Oriel College
OL,14,Ffor a demonstration opposing Nathan
OL,15,FCofnas's event on Tuesday evening.
OL,17,FThames Valley Police said that the
OL,18,Fplanned protest had happened lawfully,
OL,19,Fbut officers were called after "some
OL,20,Findividuals prevented guests from
OL,21,Fattending".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
